  "name": "Relentless Avenger",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your supernatural focus helps you close off a foe's retreat. When you hit a creature with an Opportunity Attacks, you can reduce the creature's Speed to 0 until the end of the current turn. You can then move up to half your Speed as part of the same Reaction. This movement doesn't provoke Opportunity Attacks.</p>",
